flowchart LR
    DEV[Developer push to source branch] --> J[Jenkins controller on EKS]
    J --> A[Kubernetes agent pod]
    A --> K[Kaniko builds image]
    K --> ECR[Amazon ECR]
    A --> G[Git container updates values.yaml]
    G --> GR[GitOps repository main]
    GR --> ARGO[Argo CD reconciliation]
    ARGO --> HELM[Helm render]
    HELM --> K8S[Django Deployment / Service / HPA]
    K8S --> LB[AWS Load Balancer]
